#. y1:english="Kazuma,{PA:10} do you have any leads?\nNo.{PA:10} Nothing.{PA:20}||I'll go out and gather some info.\nThat doesn't sound too efficient.{PA:10} Okay.{PA:20}||We better go talk to the famous \"informant\".\nYou mean...{PA:10}||the \"Legendary Informant\"?\nYeah.{PA:20} So, you know about him.\n\"Kage of Purgatory\"...{PA:20}||The informant that supposedly knows all.\nWell,{PA:10} he's inside a park.\nYou mean {MS:0}\"{CC:ffc8c8}West Park{CR:00}\"...\nYeah.{PA:20} But the nickname is \"Purgatory\"...||The place is home to thousands of tramps.\nHe's somewhere inside Purgatory.\nBut be careful.{PA:20}||That place is dangerous, even for cops.\nOnce you go in,{PA:10}||you might never be able to get out.\nI have no other choice but to go.{PA:20}||I have no time to lose.\nDetective Date,{PA:10}||can you take care of Haruka?\nYeah.{PA:20} This isn't exactly the safest place,||but I'll take care of her.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0082.BIN:23_2_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0082.BIN::line:23_2_0"
msgid "Kazuma, {PA:10}¿tienes alguna pista?"
msgstr ""

